OL,5,CDUBLINFEvelyn Glenholmes
OL,6,F freed a second time...........103B203
OL,8,CNORTHERN IRELANDFHurd warns
OL,9, FUnionists over agreement......104B204
OL,10,F
OL,11,CWAPPINGF8,000 marchers converge
OL,12,F on print works................114B214
OL,14,CNUCLEAR TESTSFUS goes ahead....105B205
OL,15,F Owen urges test ban...........106B206
OL,16,F
OL,17,CPETROLFMotorists queue at
OL,18,F "no rise" garages.............108B208
OL,19,F
OL,20,CCRICKETFThird Test latest......141
OL,22,T]F This Ceefax page is fromC22-03-86
